From: =?UTF-8?q?John=20T=C3=B6rnblom?= <john.tornblom@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 10:45:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] SDL: Vulkan on a whole display when SDL has no window
 manager info

SDL video drivers that draw on a whole display, such as the PS4's, have
no window manager info, so SDL_GetWindowWMInfo() fails there. With
VK_USE_PLATFORM_DISPLAY_KHR, use the VK_KHR_display surface then, as for
KMSDRM, instead of exiting.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01P3uAWaEfvY2JvhAv7RuSyc
---
 SDL/SDLVulkanGraphicsContext.cpp | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/SDL/SDLVulkanGraphicsContext.cpp b/SDL/SDLVulkanGraphicsContext.cpp
index 47d0569..96838ef 100644
--- a/SDL/SDLVulkanGraphicsContext.cpp
+++ b/SDL/SDLVulkanGraphicsContext.cpp
@@ -84,8 +84,14 @@ bool SDLVulkanGraphicsContext::Init(SDL_Window *&window, int x, int y, int w, in
 	SDL_SysWMinfo sys_info{};
 	SDL_VERSION(&sys_info.version); //Set SDL version
 	if (!SDL_GetWindowWMInfo(window, &sys_info)) {
+#if defined(VK_USE_PLATFORM_DISPLAY_KHR)
+		// Video drivers without window manager info (such as the PS4's)
+		// show the window on a whole display: use VK_KHR_display.
+		sys_info.subsystem = SDL_SYSWM_UNKNOWN;
+#else
 		fprintf(stderr, "Error getting SDL window wm info: %s\n", SDL_GetError());
 		exit(1);
+#endif
 	}
 	switch (sys_info.subsystem) {
 	case SDL_SYSWM_X11:
@@ -114,6 +120,7 @@ bool SDLVulkanGraphicsContext::Init(SDL_Window *&window, int x, int y, int w, in
 #endif
 #endif
 #if defined(VK_USE_PLATFORM_DISPLAY_KHR)
+	case SDL_SYSWM_UNKNOWN:
 	case SDL_SYSWM_KMSDRM:
 		/*
 		There is no problem passing null for the next two arguments, and reinit will be called later
-- 
